# Cloudflare Pages — response headers
# Conservative, safe defaults. No CSP here (would need to allowlist Google
# Translate, Google Fonts, flagcdn, Web3Forms first). Enable HSTS in the
# Cloudflare dashboard: SSL/TLS → Edge Certificates → HSTS.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
